        ObjectId("6138f199a4e85c00156f584b")
    ], 
    "body" : "Worked during pandemic remotely, so overall engagement was down. Worked on a few large projects throughout the term and was treated like a full time as it was my second coop on the team. Was given full ownership of the projects (meaning I make the decisions on how to do it for 4 months; no step by step instructions).  This is good and bad, it trains me to be significantly more independent, but limits how quickly I can pick up many skills - get really good at a few things vs. learn a little about a lot of things.", 
