        ObjectId("60f9aedf20567c0015f63c8f")
    ], 
    "body" : "I was hired and laid off by KGS Research around last year or so and I’d just like to give everybody advice by saying not work for KGS Research. I will be extremely respectful, I won’t mention specific business practices, nor list names.\n\nI worked when COVID was in full-force and all other companies were starting to let you work remote. KGS Research had an in-person party for Eid in May of 2020. I enjoy festivals and celebrations, but not during a pandemic, especially when we weren’t sure what was going to happen next. It had mandatory attendance.\n\nI wore a mask and socially distanced politely from people, but the boss and his brother (they’re very young, probably younger than most university students’ age) went around hugging everybody and not socially distancing.\n\nThey looked at me and told me they had a “no mask” policy (it’s a call center, they had no dress code), but I kept my mask on regardless (I just had a basic blue mask to cover my nose and mouth). They also kept reaching to hug me and I refused politely and I waved my hand to say hi nicely. They were drinking during the day and blasting music (even though drinking is not allowed during Eid). Whenever they’d see my mask they’d sarcastically ask me “Are you okay? You look like an alien!”\n\nI’m a man so I don’t believe they were being nasty by trying to hug me, they were very young so I think they were just trying to be “bros”, but this was during the pandemic and my grandmother had passed away from COVID so I didn’t want to take any risks.\n\nA few days after the party I was suddenly laid off from the company for “not being a cultural fit”. They didn’t even have the respect to tell me over the phone that they laid me off.\n\nI was given no prior warnings. Anyways, a few days after the party, they locked my company account in the middle of one of my shifts and I couldn’t log in. I had to call the receptionist and call around for an hour to get to the boss’s number and extension, who only then told me “You don’t wo", 
